# baseline-associative-dup-guard.baseline
#
# Scripts whose declare -A + while-read baseline loaders currently lack
# a [[ -v ]] dup guard.  Entries here are pre-existing debt; the gate
# reports them as ADVISORY rather than FAIL.  Remove an entry once its
# loader acquires a guard.  This list must only shrink.
